tItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":3245640,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-3245640","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T07:53:20Z","value":7,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4249860","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3245640-1846651706682537","game_id":"steam-3245640","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.2.21710 - One Month In","summary":"Hello Starfinders! ⭐ It has been a month since the demo launched. Over 26,000 downloads, 128 countries, 96% completion rate, and 1,500+ survey responses, with a ton of useful feedback. Thank you! Early Access: We are moving the launch from Q4 2026 to Q1 2027. We need the extra time to address the feedback from the Demo. Performance, navigation, combat feel, and UI are areas that need more polish, and we want to make something we can be proud of. You only get one shot at Early Access, and we want","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T17:33:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706682537","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3245640-1843481262692194","game_id":"steam-3245640","kind":"announcement","title":"100,000 Wishlists and the Demo goes live today!","summary":"Hello crew! ⭐ Today we have some news worth celebrating, twice!To begin, Starfinder: Afterlight crossed 100,000 wishlists. Thousands of you believed in this project since we announced it, then came the Kickstarter, and you kept sharing it and telling us you wanted to learn more. We thank you from the bottom of our hearts!And there is no better day to mark it than today, because the demo will be live in a few hours!To celebrate, if you want a taste of the story before you dive in, we just dropped","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T13:19:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262692194","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3245640-1842212951297744","game_id":"steam-3245640","kind":"announcement","title":"Meet Preach","summary":"Hey Starfinders ⭐Last week we introduced you to Kole. This week, we bring you the second companion in the demo.Meet Preach:A Shirren Mystic and devoted priest of the church of Hylax. Wise, ambitious, and never seen without the Golden Larva tucked safely in his robes.Preach is the party's healer and support, but do not let the robes fool you. Behind the calm demeanor is someone who has decided that history will remember his name.\"Each one of our choices, no matter how insignificant they may seem,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T17:54:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951297744","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3245640-1841579228666141","game_id":"steam-3245640","kind":"announcement","title":"Get to Know Kole","summary":"Hello Starfinders ⭐Following last week's demo announcement, it's the right time to introduce you to the first companion you will meet in the demo.Meet Kole:A Vesk Soldier, built like a tank, with enough firepower to back it up. In combat, Kole is exactly what you would expect: heavy weapons, suppressive fire, and a tolerance for incoming damage that borders on unreasonable.Off the battlefield, he is something else entirely.The other Kole:Kole is the heart of the party. Warm and funny, quietly ca","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-20T16:17:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228666141","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3245640-1840944183774501","game_id":"steam-3245640","kind":"announcement","title":"The Demo is coming on September 10th","summary":"Hello Starfinders ⭐Last week we showed you how we build our animatics. This week, we finally have a date:Afterlight's demo goes live on September 10th.What is in the demo?The opening of the game, from the prologue through the first stretch of Act 1, with around 1h to 2h of gameplay.During the demo, you will get to know Kole, Preach, and Sterling, as well as some other key allies and enemies.Who can I play?There are three pre-generated characters: a Vesk Envoy, a Human Soldier, and a Shirren Oper","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-12T16:38:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183774501","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3245640-1840310314339908","game_id":"steam-3245640","kind":"announcement","title":"Comics in Motion","summary":"Hey Starfinders ⭐Last week we introduced the Golden Larva plushie. This week, we have one of our creative development challenges: how we built the animatics for Afterlight.These are the motion comic sequences that play between acts, giving the story context and setting the tone before you take control. Here is how they get made.Ideation, script, and rough sketches The narrative team comes up with the initial concept for the animatic, taking into account what purpose it will serve for the story a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-05T18:11:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314339908","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3245640-1839676055882672","game_id":"steam-3245640","kind":"announcement","title":"Meet the Larva, in plushie form!","summary":"Hello Starfinders ⭐Today we have something a bit different, but don't worry, next week we are back to game updates!Some of you have been asking about this since the Kickstarter campaign.We couldn't make it then, we are very excited that it is finally here!The Golden Larva quickly became one of the most beloved characters during the March playtest, and we always wanted to bring it to life in physical form. We partnered with Type40, the same team behind Paizo's Captain Consierge plushie, to make i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-29T14:19:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055882672","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3245640-1839041357024541","game_id":"steam-3245640","kind":"announcement","title":"The Hotbar, Redesigned","summary":"Hey Starfinders ⭐Last week we drew our weapons, showcasing the Solarian - Morningstar. This week, as promised, we are bringing you the redesigned hotbar.The old hotbarThis is what the hotbar looked like during the March playtest. The character portrait and weapon slots were anchored to the bottom left of the screen, which meant players constantly had to move their attention to the corner to fire weapons or use abilities. And beyond the layout, there was a bigger problem: a classical hotbar would","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-22T16:43:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357024541","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3245640-1838407329254652","game_id":"steam-3245640","kind":"announcement","title":"Solarian weapons - The Morningstar","summary":"Hello Starfinders ⭐Last week we introduced the Minister of Flesh. This week we were planning to show you the hotbar redesign, but there are still a few things we want to finish before we show it properly, so it will need to wait til next week.Instead, today we take a look at one of the Solarian weapons you will be wielding in Afterlight.Solarian Weapons - The MorningstarThe Solarian is one of the classes in Starfinder: Afterlight. Instead of carrying conventional weapons, Solarians manifest them","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-15T16:19:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329254652","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3245640-1836506165581330","game_id":"steam-3245640","kind":"announcement","title":"Meet the Minister of Flesh","summary":"Hello Starfinders ⭐Last week we went underground and discovered the tunnels. Today we unveil one of the key villains of Starfinder: Afterlight.Meet the Minister of FleshAn Azrinaran Elf from Apostae and a hired weapon for a powerful patron. Broken by a traumatic past and driven by a voice only he can hear, Velkan does not simply kill, he crafts. Every target is an elaborate, sadistic performance, and your group is his next show.He has a particular fixation with one of your companions. Why does t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-08T17:15:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165581330","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3245640-1836506165565789","game_id":"steam-3245640","kind":"announcement","title":"The Tunnels","summary":"Hey Starfinders ⭐Last week we showed you how animations are made. This week, we go underground.Down in the TunnelsThe Tunnels run beneath Hivemarket, connecting areas of the city, and parts that do not appear on any official map.Dark, tight, and full of danger, the perfect place to run \"unofficial\" business.Nobody comes down here willingly, and nobody stays longer than necessary. But some answers don't surface on their own.The Tunnels are currently in the beautification pass and actively being p","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-01T15:39:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165565789","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3245640-1836506165546284","game_id":"steam-3245640","kind":"announcement","title":"Let's move!","summary":"Hello Starfinders ⭐Last week we showed you Khali, from concept to 3D. This week, we hand it over to the animation team.For those who took part in our beta, animation was one of the common pieces of feedback.Animation is a discipline that keeps evolving until the end of a project.Our current priority is getting all animations in the game, and once that is done, we move into polish and refinement. Some animations may look rough for now until we get there.Here is what that process looks like, step ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-24T15:15:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165546284","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3245640-1835871199300728","game_id":"steam-3245640","kind":"announcement","title":"Meet Khali, your captain","summary":"Hey Starfinders ⭐Last week we unveiled one of the levels you will visit in Act 1: The Docks. This week, we bring you one of the key characters of the game.Meet Khali, your captain and one of the central characters in Afterlight. Your journey begins with her...And here is how she went from concept art to a game-ready 3D model.Meet Khali - From Concept to 3D modelEverything begins with the concept art, then the 3D character team picks up. Silhouette, colour palette, weapons, and the details that m","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-17T13:50:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199300728","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3245640-1835236783557885","game_id":"steam-3245640","kind":"announcement","title":"Welcome to the Docks!","summary":"Hello Starfinders ⭐We have been quiet for a while, but from this week on, we will be posting regular updates on Steam: environment screenshots, system deep-dives, work in progress, and more. Hopefully, one post a week, all the way to Early Access.To kick things off, a first look at the Docks, one of the areas you will visit on Act 1, available on Early Access in 2026.Welcome to the DocksThe Docks are a working port in the Hivemarket on Akiton, where freight moves, deals get made, and the wrong p","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-10T15:12:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783557885","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3245640-1830163047255121","game_id":"steam-3245640","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest Wrap-Up: Numbers, Feedback, and Whats Next","summary":"Hello Starfinders ⭐With the Playtest now behind us, we've spent some time going through the data and feedback you gave us. Here's a summary of what we found. Thanks again to all who played the playtest, especially to those who took the time to give feedback; it helped us to validate what works and what needs some love. Overall, we are happy to see that we are aligned and there were no big \"surprises\" for us. The Playtest in numbersAround 18,000 players got access to the playtest, from over 60 co","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-15T14:50:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047255121","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3245640-1827626365768404","game_id":"steam-3245640","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest - 11,000+ Players already In","summary":"Hello Starfinders ⭐Last week, we started by inviting a small group of players into the Starfinder: Afterlight Playtest.Since then, the number of players waiting for access has grown beyond our expectations.Because of that, we have decided to continue inviting players every day until March 31.The Playtest in numbersOver 11,000 players already in5,000+ invites sent1,000+ players joined through friend invitesDaily Invite waves until March 31 📨We are continuing to expand access to the Playtest. New ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-25T15:40:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365768404","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3245640-1827626365757919","game_id":"steam-3245640","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest – First wave of invites sent","summary":"Yesterday, we sent the first 1000 1,500 invites to players who signed up for the Starfinder: Afterlight Playtest.The response was higher than we could anticipate, so we increased the initial wave to bring more of you into the game 💫If you couldn’t make it this time, don’t despair. We will be sending another wave of invites next week. We want to keep the test relatively small so we can properly support everyone who joins. Thanks for understanding 👥 Sharing is CaringIf you’ve been selected for the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-20T14:54:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365757919","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3245640-1826992588593604","game_id":"steam-3245640","kind":"announcement","title":"Pubilc Playtest available on March 19th","summary":"🌌 Steam Playtest Open!Today, we are opening the Steam Playtest sign-up.Players can now request access through Steam for a chance to join the Beta.On March 19th, we will invite 1,000 players from the playtest pool to participate.🛡 Beta Update 3 is now live!Human Soldier is now available as a pre-generated character.• New Playable Character: Human Soldier is now available.• New Weapon: Roto Laser added to the Human Soldier’s available equipment.• Barks: Added character barks for dying, death, and ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-12T19:36:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826992588593604","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3245640-1826362059921997","game_id":"steam-3245640","kind":"update","title":"Closed Beta - Update 2","summary":"🪐First week Beta recapOn February 26th we launched the Closed Beta. After the first week, we wanted to share with you how things are going:🔑 Over 1,800 keys activated👥 1,500 unique players⏱ 36 minutes median playtime📋+450 Beta 